## Ticket #1 – User Locked Out of Domain Account

### Issue Summary
User reported being unable to log into domain-joined workstation (PC1).
Error message indicated account was locked after multiple failed login attempts.

### Triage Process
1. Confirmed issue description and symptoms.
2. Attempted login to replicate behavior.
3. Verified lockout condition in Active Directory Users and Computers (ADUC).

### Root Cause
Account lockout triggered due to multiple incorrect password attempts.

### Resolution Steps
1. Accessed ADUC on DC1.
2. Navigated to user object (J.Smith).
3. Confirmed account lock status.
4. Unlocked account via Account tab.
5. Instructed user to retry login.
6. Verified successful authentication to PC1.

### Validation
User successfully logged into domain workstation after unlock.

